k titans.Unlock New Abilities - Discover a variety of unique abilities to help you on your quest.Escape the Factory - Solve puzzles and navigate treac","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:30:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3131340-1822556746162392","game_id":"steam-3131340","kind":"announcement","title":"Lelu demo v2.2","summary":"Hey all, new update with a few important fixes:Screen resolution (should) be mostly fixed for all common monitor sizesMinor enemy fixesNumerous bugsThanks,Jamie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-01-23T17:00:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1822556746162392","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3131340-1819386365097754","game_id":"steam-3131340","kind":"announcement","title":"Lelu demo v2.0","summary":"Hey all, new update with a few important fixes:Removed input buffer after cutscenes/camera scenes to prevent dashing to your doomSteam screenshots enabled (F12)Fixed completion percentageAdded a few more cosmetics and updated the shop economyUpdated the item collect scene & added a unique battery collect sceneThanks,Jamie","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-20T10:58:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1819386365097754","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:46:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3131340-1818752592130879","game_id":"steam-3131340","kind":"announcement","title":"Lelu demo v1.9","summary":"Hey all. Thanks so much for playing the demo so far. 